Description: Implements the age-specific Physiologically Based Pharmacokinetic model for lead,
    originally developed by Leggett (1993) <doi:10.1289/ehp.93101598> and
    updated by Vork et al. (2023) <doi:10.1080/15459624.2022.2150767>.
    The model was coded in 'R' and validated against the original MATLAB implementation
    by Hsing-Chieh and Coffin (2025).
    'LeggettPlus' supports simulation of time-varying exposure scenarios,
    including continuous and pulse exposures, and predicts lead kinetics across
    multiple physiological compartments over the lifespan.
    It also includes an optional 'Shiny' application.
    Physiological parameters and calibration constants are derived from adult
    male reference and occupational-worker data; no female-specific parameter
    set is implemented.
